ect\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" object represents a closed shape consisting of four or more","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"vertices, specified as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CLLocationCoordinate2D"},{"text":" instances, and the edges that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"connect them. For example, you could use a polygon shape to represent a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"building, a lake, or an area you want to highlight."}]}}}